{"availability":"available","full":"junaid51/job-pulse","name":"job-pulse","description":"Watches public company job boards and pushes new matches to your phone. One Go binary, Postgres, a React PWA, and a daily LLM scout that finds employers' direct boards.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Go","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-19T08:29:59Z","updated":"2026-10-10T09:59:15Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://jobpulse-junaid.web.app","topics":["go","job-search","llm-agent","playwright","postgresql","pwa","react"],"demo":"https://jobpulse-junaid.web.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:19.873Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:19.873Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:19.873Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T19:51:19.873Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Go"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Watches public company job boards and pushes a new matching job to your phone within minutes of it appearing.","Live at jobpulse-junaid.web.app. One Go binary (poller plus REST API), one PostgreSQL database, one React PWA. The backend polls about 220 boards across thirteen hiring providers every five minutes, stores what is new, matches it against saved searches, and sends one push per search per cycle. It runs entirely on free tiers.","The design, and every decision not to build something, is in ARCHITECTURE.md. Read that before adding anything."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/junaid51/job-pulse/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"be07279b4d85f269554187d7a59fbf2a5ca0ca579c2103cace85496a3bbaab06","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:20.026Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:20.026Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Watches public company job boards and pushes a new matching job to your phone within minutes of it appearing.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/junaid51/job-pulse/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"finger